# The test suite assumes an LF checkout: a dozen source walks split on "\n}\n", the rule
# frontmatter parser, and the packaging text compared against LICENSE all fail on a CRLF copy.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Signed fixtures. Git must not rewrite a byte on the way out — a CRLF conversion here breaks
# every minisign verification test, and the damage is invisible until someone clones on Windows.
*.minisig -text
